{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2021-09-09 09:30:00', 'title': 'LYONDELLBASELL GAINS ISCC PLUS CERTIFICATION TO EXTEND CIRCULEN PRODUCT LINE TO NORTH AMERICA', 'text': 'HOUSTON, SEPT. 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LYONDELLBASELL (NYSE: LYB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY HAS OBTAINED THE\xa0INTERNATIONAL SUSTAINABILITY AND CARBON CERTIFICATION (ISCC) PLUS CERTIFICATION\xa0FOR CERTAIN GRADES OF POLYETHYLENE AND POLYPROPYLENE PRODUCED AT FOUR OF ITS U.S. MANUFACTURING SITES.'}